The WCH antenna geometry in these files is derived from the reference antenna
published by Nanjing Qinheng Microelectronics Co., Ltd. (WCH):

* CH570/lib/OpenDongle.pretty/ANT-F-2-2.4G-0.8MM-FR4-WCH.kicad_mod
* CH592/lib/OpenDongle.pretty/ANT-F-2-2.4G-0.8MM-FR4-WCH.kicad_mod
* The corresponding routed antenna geometry in each OpenDongle PCB

Upstream source: https://github.com/openwch/schpcb_lib

That upstream repository does not currently include an explicit license.
Consequently, OpenKeyboard.org does not claim to relicense the WCH-derived
antenna geometry under CERN-OHL-W-2.0. The attribution is retained here and in
the footprint descriptions. Permission or a replacement with independently
created antenna geometry is still required to make the licensing of those
portions unambiguous.
